st about 12–15 minutes more, until salmon reaches 63°C.","Check the potato is tender and finish with lemon juice."],"steps_ar":["سخن الفرن إلى ٢٠٠°م وقطع البطاطا واخلطها بالزيت واشوها ١٥ دقيقة.","أضف السلمون والهليون واشو ١٢–١٥ دقيقة إضافية حتى يبلغ السلمون ٦٣°م.","تأكد من طراوة البطاطا وأضف عصير الليمون."],"tags":["Tray bake"],"allergens":["Fish"],"image":"assets/recipes/13.webp","status":"published","version":1,"notes":"Quantities refer to the ingredient state listed. Nutrition is estimated from ingredient references; brands and cooking yields vary. The photograph is a serving suggestion.","notes_ar":"الأوزان حسب حالة المكون الموضحة. القيم الغذائية تقديرية وتختلف باختلاف المنتجات والطهي. الصورة اقتراح للتقديم.","source":"Panda Kitchen · estimated ingredient values","created_at":"2026-09-13","updated_at":"2026-09-13"},"recipe_servings":1.25,"recipe_note":""}]},{"id":"day-2","name":"Menu 2","meals":[{"id":"meal_3","name":"Spinach feta omelette","name_ar":"أومليت السبانخ والفيتا","time":"07:30","instructions":"Wilt the spinach in the oil in a small non-stick pan. Beat the eggs and pour over the spinach.\n\nCook gently, add the feta and fold when the egg is fully set.\n\nToast the bread and serve with the omelette and tomatoes.","instructions_ar":"ذبّل السبانخ بالزيت في مقلاة صغيرة ثم أضف البيض المخفوق.\n\nاطه بهدوء وأضف الفيتا واطو الأومليت بعد نضج البيض تماماً.\n\nحمص الخبز وقدمه مع الأومليت والطماطم.","items":[{"food_id":"ingredient_egg","quantity":125.0},{"food_id":"ingredient_spinach","quantity":75.0},{"food_id":"ingredient_feta","quantity":37.5},{"food_id":"ingredient_tomato","quantity":125.0},{"food_id":"ingredient_bread","quantity":62.5},{"food_id":"ingredient_oil","quantity":5.0}],"image":"assets/recipes/03.webp","recipe_snapshot":{"id":"recipe_03","name":"Spinach feta omelette","name_ar":"أومليت السبانخ والفيتا","category":"Breakfast","minutes":15,"wait_minutes":0,"servings":1,"summary":"A simple start, with clear portions and everyday ingredients.","summary