الة المكون الموضحة. القيم الغذائية تقديرية وتختلف باختلاف المنتجات والطهي. الصورة اقتراح للتقديم.","source":"Panda Kitchen · estimated ingredient values","created_at":"2026-09-13","updated_at":"2026-09-13"},"recipe_servings":1.25,"recipe_note":""},{"id":"meal_19","name":"Chicken and red lentil curry","name_ar":"كاري الدجاج والعدس الأحمر","time":"12:30","instructions":"Soften onion in oil, add chicken cubes and curry spices, and stir for 3 minutes.\n\nAdd rinsed lentils, passata, coconut milk and 150 g water. Simmer 20 minutes, adding more water if needed.\n\nCheck the lentils are tender and chicken is at least 74°C; stir in spinach to wilt.","instructions_ar":"لين البصل بالزيت وأضف مكعبات الدجاج وبهارات الكاري وقلب ٣ دقائق.\n\nأضف العدس المغسول والطماطم وحليب جوز الهند و١٥٠ غ ماء واطه ٢٠ دقيقة مع إضافة الماء عند الحاجة.\n\nتأكد من طراوة العدس ووصول الدجاج إلى ٧٤°م ثم أضف السبانخ.","items":[{"food_id":"ingredient_chicken","quantity":187.5},{"food_id":"ingredient_lentildry","quantity":56.25},{"food_id":"ingredient_passata","quantity":150.0},{"food_id":"ingredient_coconut","quantity":100.0},{"food_id":"ingredient_spinach","quantity":75.0},{"food_id":"ingredient_onion","quantity":62.5},{"food_id":"ingredient_oil","quantity":6.25},{"food_id":"ingredient_spice","quantity":3.75}],"image":"assets/recipes/19.webp","recipe_snapshot":{"id":"recipe_19","name":"Chicken and red lentil curry","name_ar":"كاري الدجاج والعدس الأحمر","category":"Main meals","minutes":35,"wait_minutes":0,"servings":1,"summary":"A complete, practical plate for your weekly meal plan.","summary_ar":"وجبة متكاملة وعملية ضمن خطة طعامك الأسبوعية.","ingredients":[{"id":"chicken","name":"Chicken breast · raw, skinless","name_ar":"صدر دجاج نيئ دون الجلد","protein":23,"carbs":0,"fat":2,"fiber":0,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":150},{"id":"lentildry","name":"Red lentils · dry","name_ar":"عدس أحمر جاف","protein":24,"carbs":50,"fat":1.5,"fiber":11,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":45},{"id":"passata","name":"Passata · plain tomato","name_ar":"طماطم مهروسة سادة","protein":1.5,"carbs":4,"fat":0.3,"fiber":1.5,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":120},{"id":"coconut","name":"Coconut milk · light","name_ar":"حليب جوز الهند الخفيف","protein":0.8,"carbs":2,"fat":7,"fiber":0,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":80},{"id":"spinach","name":"Spinach · raw","name_ar":"سبانخ نيئة","protein":2.9,"carbs":1.4,"fat":0.4,"fiber":2.2,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":60},{"id":"onion","name":"Onion · raw","name_ar":"بصل نيئ","protein":1.1,"carbs":7.5,"fat":0.1,"fiber":1.7,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":50},{"id":"oil","name":"Olive oil","name_ar":"زيت زيتون","protein":0,"carbs":0,"fat":100,"fiber":0,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":5},{"id":"spice","name":"Ground spice mix · unsalted","name_ar":"بهارات مطحونة دون ملح","protein":10,"carbs":35,"fat":10,"fiber":20,"allergens":"Check blend","unit":"g","quantity":3}],"steps":["Soften onion in oil, add chicken cubes and curry spices, and stir for 3 minutes.","Add rinsed lentils, passata, coconut milk and 150 g water. Simmer 20 minutes, adding more water if needed.","Check the lentils are tender and chicken is at least 74°C; stir in spinach to wilt."],"steps_ar":["لين البصل بالزيت وأضف مكعبات الدجاج وبهارات الكاري وقلب ٣ دقائق.","أضف العدس المغسول والطماطم وحليب جوز الهند و١٥٠ غ ماء واطه ٢٠ دقيقة مع إضافة الماء عند الحاجة.","تأكد من طراوة العدس ووصول الدجاج إلى ٧٤°م ثم أضف السبانخ."],"tags":["Meal prep"],"allergens":["Check blend"],"image":"assets/recipes/19.webp","status":"published","version":1,"notes":"Quantities refer to the ingredient state listed. Nutrition is estimated from ingredient references; brands and cooking yields vary. The photograph is a serving suggestion.","notes_ar":"الأوزان حسب حالة المكون الموضحة. القيم الغذائية تقديرية وتختلف باختلاف المنتجات والطهي. الصورة اقتراح للتقديم.","source":"Panda Kitchen · estimated ingredient values","created_at":"2026-09-13","updated_at":"2026-09-13"},"recipe_servings":1.25,"reci