},{"id":"pita","name":"Wholegrain pita","name_ar":"خبز بيتا كامل الحبوب","protein":9,"carbs":48,"fat":2,"fiber":6,"allergens":"Wheat, Gluten","unit":"g","quantity":60},{"id":"spice","name":"Ground spice mix · unsalted","name_ar":"بهارات مطحونة دون ملح","protein":10,"carbs":35,"fat":10,"fiber":20,"allergens":"Check blend","unit":"g","quantity":2}],"steps":["Soften diced onion and pepper in the oil for 5 minutes. Add passata and spices; simmer for 8 minutes.","Make two wells, add the eggs and cover. Cook gently until whites and yolks are firm.","Warm the pita and serve alongside the skillet."],"steps_ar":["لين البصل والفلفل بالزيت ٥ دقائق ثم أضف الطماطم والبهارات واطه ٨ دقائق.","اصنع فجوتين وأضف البيض وغط المقلاة حتى يتماسك البياض والصفار.","سخن الخبز وقدمه بجانب الشكشوكة."],"tags":["Vegetarian"],"allergens":["Check blend","Egg","Gluten","Wheat"],"image":"assets/recipes/07.webp","status":"published","version":1,"notes":"Quantities refer to the ingredient state listed. Nutrition is estimated from ingredient references; brands and cooking yields vary. The photograph is a serving suggestion.","notes_ar":"الأوزان حسب حالة المكون الموضحة. القيم الغذائية تقديرية وتختلف باختلاف المنتجات والطهي. الصورة اقتراح للتقديم.","source":"Panda Kitchen · estimated ingredient values","created_at":"2026-09-13","updated_at":"2026-09-13"},"recipe_servings":1.25,"recipe_note":""},{"id":"meal_21","name":"Tofu quinoa vegetable bowl","name_ar":"بول التوفو والكينوا والخضار","time":"12:30","instructions":"Drain and pat the tofu dry, then cut into cubes. Pan-fry in the oil until golden on several sides.\n\nSteam broccoli and sliced carrot. Weigh the quinoa after cooking.\n\nToss tofu with soy sauce and serve with the quinoa and vegetables.","instructions_ar":"صف التوفو وجففه وقطعه مكعبات وحمره بالزيت من عدة جوانب.\n\nاطه البروكلي وشرائح الجزر بالبخار وزن الكينوا بعد الطهي.\n\nاخلط التوفو بصلصة الصويا وقدمه مع الكينوا والخضار.","items":[{"food_id":"ingredient_tofu","quantity":225.0},{"food_id":"in